{"ref":"BDB, קָלוֹן","hw":"קָלוֹן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">קָלוֹן</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.2\">Pr 11:2</a></sup> <strong>ignominy, dishonour</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 4:7\" href=\"/Hosea.4.7\">Ho 4:7</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">קְלוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.18\">Is 22:18</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">קְלוֹנֵךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:26\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.26\">Je 13:26</a> +;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  of national <em>ignominy</em> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 4:7\" href=\"/Hosea.4.7\">Ho 4:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Hosea 4:18\" href=\"/Hosea.4.18\">18</a> (dub. line, v. Che Now), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 46:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.46.12\">Je 46:12</a> (read prob. <span dir=\"rtl\">קוֹלֵךְ</span>, so 𝔊 Gie Co<sup>Hpt</sup>), <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 2:16\" href=\"/Habakkuk.2.16\">Hb 2:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 83:17\" href=\"/Psalms.83.17\">ψ 83:17</a> of nation under fig. of woman, = pudenda, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:26\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.26\">Je 13:26</a> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:5\" href=\"/Nahum.3.5\">Na 3:5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעְרֵךְ</span>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  personal <em>dishonour, disgrace</em>, of Shebna, as <em>disgrace</em> to his lord’s house <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.18\">Is 22:18</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּבוֹדֶ֑ךָ</span>); individ., <a data-ref=\"Job 10:15\" href=\"/Job.10.15\">Jb 10:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:35\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.35\">Pr 3:35</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּבוֹד</span>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:33\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.33\">6:33</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 9:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.9.7\">9:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.2\">11:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.16\">12:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.18\">13:18</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְכֻבָּ֑ד</span>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.3\">18:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.10\">22:10</a>.","next":"BDB, קַלַּ֫חַת","prev":"BDB, קָלָה²"}